  "body": "## Summary\n- Writes `G04 F<seconds>` for iTNC 530 and controls before FUNCTION DWELL support in Heidenhain DIN/ISO post.\n- Writes documented `FUNCTION DWELL TIME <seconds>` with a space before the value where valid (TNC 640 >= -07, TNC 620 >= -04, TNC 320 >= -04, TNC 128 >= -05, TNC7).\n\n## Verification\n- Verified with `cargo test -p camcraft-post --test heidenhain_block_form` and `cargo test -p camcraft-post --test heidenhain_cycles`.\n- Pinned by `heidenhain_dwell_writes_g04_f_for_itnc_and_function_dwell_for_newer` and `nonzero_entry_peck_and_deep_and_backbore_keep_the_expanded_chain`.\n- Shift-left CodeRabbit review completed with 0 findings.\n\nFixes #4093\nChangelog: Heidenhain DIN/ISO post: write G04 F dwell for iTNC 530 instead of unsupported FUNCTION DWELL\r\n",
